\ **************************************************************************
\ *
\ *    The decruncher: Exomizer's
\ *
\ *    exodecrs/exodecrunch.s from Exomizer 3.1.2 (Magnus Lind,
\ *    https://bitbucket.org/magli143/exomizer), ported to Baron.
\ *
\ *    THIS IS AN ALTERED VERSION. Changes from the original: Baron syntax
\ *    throughout; the options below are set here rather than by .IFNDEF
\ *    defaults; zero page moved to &70-&78 (the original's &9E-&AF and
\ *    &FD-&FF are BBC OS workspace, &FF the Escape flag); and the 156-byte
\ *    table, decrunch_table, placed by the includer, as the original
\ *    allows. The code itself is the original's, line for line. The
\ *    includer also supplies get_crunched_byte.
\ *
\ *    The original's notice:
\ *
